# Precomputed council flood datasets (~222 MB; Gold Coast alone is 210 MB).
# Built by floodcheck-backend/scripts/precompute_council.py and archived
# separately rather than versioned: git cannot delta-compress GeoJSON, so every
# regeneration would add the full size to history again, permanently.
#
# The app needs these at runtime - restore the folder before building or
# deploying.
public/councils/

